msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Oh! Kiryu-san. Long time no see. I guess you found out about my store "
"somehow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"<Color:7>Renji Kamiyama<Color:Default>\r\n"
"Resident of Kamurocho who Kiryu met by chance two years ago. Sells rare martial arts videos and handmade weapons. Good friends with Majima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Yeah. Your brother emailed me about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "My brother? You mean Renta?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Yeah, and I also met your master, Yonashiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "You met Yona-san, too!? Sheesh, my life's like an open book to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Huh? Is something wrong?"
msgstr "Hm? C'è qualcosa che non va?"

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"No, it's just, I'm the kind of guy who likes to keep personal information "
"like that private. Never mind about me, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I have to say you still look like you could kick some serious ass. "
"How about buying something to ramp up the ass-kicking level?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"I have some of the same stuff as over at Renta's place, and even some stuff "
"he doesn't have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You can modify your weapons, gear, and accessories here."
msgstr "Qui puoi modificare le tue armi, equipaggiamento e accessori."

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Start by getting all the required items.\r\n"
"Then, make a selection on the Mod menu to modify equipped items.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You will need a <Color:255,255,0,255>design from a book or DVD<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"a <Color:255,255,0,255>weapon or piece of equipment<Color:Default> to  mod,\r\n"
"<Color:255,255,0,255>materials<Color:Default> with which to complete the mod,\r\n"
"and the <Color:255,255,0,255>funds<Color:Default> to cover Kamiyama's costs."
msgstr ""
"Inizia recuperando tutti gli oggetti necessari. Poi, scegli dal menu "
"Modifica cosa vuoi potenziare tra gli oggetti equipaggiati. Ti serviranno "
"uno <Color:255,255,0,255>schema da un libro o un DVD<Color:Default>, "
"un'<Color:255,255,0,255>arma o un pezzo d'equipaggiamento<Color:Default> da "
"potenziare, i <Color:255,255,0,255>materiali<Color:Default> per completare "
"il potenziamento, e i <Color:255,255,0,255>fondi<Color:Default> per coprire "
"i costi di Kamiyama."

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Check the required weapons and materials by displaying the Pause Menu and "
"then going to \"Designs\" under \"Valuables\" in the Items screen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"In addition to modding, I also make my own equipment. I'll show it to you, "
"if you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Hey, there. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "All right, then. Maybe next time."
msgstr "D'accordo, allora. Magari la prossima volta."

